Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.83,0:00:06.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,"For Some Reason,\Nthe Dark Summoner's a Pre-Schooler."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.92,0:00:11.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is Daiku Samona Preschool.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.63,0:00:17.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Many types of children find\Nthemselves here again today,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.08,0:00:20.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,brimming with unique personality.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.21,0:00:24.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well then, who wants to go first?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.08,0:00:30.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Today, it would seem they are all\Ndiscussing their dreams for the future.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.13,0:00:33.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ooh, me!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.13,0:00:34.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Go right ahead, Haru-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.58,0:00:37.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,I wanna buy the farm!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.50,0:00:40.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Um, why don't we give that\Na bit more thought, Haru-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.13,0:00:43.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll buy the farm, and it'll be\Nso nice and peaceful!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.13,0:00:46.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is she talking metaphorically?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.33,0:00:50.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine Haru doing anything\Nas sophisticated as that.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.04,0:00:55.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll just ask to be safe.\NWhat do you mean by "buying the farm?"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.17,0:00:55.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.88,0:00:58.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm asking what you think that means.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.38,0:00:59.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Um?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.96,0:01:00.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Scary! Scary! Scary!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.75,0:01:05.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Farms are so fun,\Nwith all the animals and everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.25,0:01:07.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,O-oh, I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.08,0:01:08.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,No need to rush, Haru.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.75,0:01:12.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Everybody buys the farm sooner or later.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.83,0:01:13.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,So blunt!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.88,0:01:15.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.17,0:01:18.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah. So why not give some thought\Nto what comes before that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.46,0:01:20.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, I will!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's your dream, then, Eury-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:25.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.21,0:01:27.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,For me, the answer's obvious.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:29.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Marrying a rich guy and being a housewife.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.58,0:01:32.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can't you say something at least a bit more\Nfitting for a pre-schooler, Eury-chan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.46,0:01:33.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's the point of teasing preschoolers\Nwith dreams that won't come true,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.96,0:01:37.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,you filthy adult?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.08,0:01:38.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Did I do something wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.04,0:01:40.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You've got such a wonderful dream, Eury-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.71,0:01:42.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Haru-chan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.04,0:01:46.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I mean, she's talking about getting married\Nand living like a princess!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.21,0:01:47.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,I guess it's all about how you phrase it...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.79,0:01:50.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Eury-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.75,0:01:53.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.75,0:01:55.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Your face is all red!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.46,0:01:57.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're imagining things!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.08,0:01:58.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, that kind of princess.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.25,0:01:58.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.92,0:02:01.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,So wait, it's Amona-chan's turn now, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.96,0:02:03.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's your dream like?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.71,0:02:07.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nothing really comes to mind...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.00,0:02:11.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh? There's nothing you\Nwant to do in the future?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.83,0:02:14.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Not really. Things will turn out\Nhow they turn out.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.83,0:02:17.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.50,0:02:20.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you're good at, Amona-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.04,0:02:21.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,What do you think you'll do?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.63,0:02:23.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't particularly care.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.33,0:02:24.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh my...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.71,0:02:27.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be a princess too, Amona-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.33,0:02:28.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.83,0:02:30.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Such a tactless man.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.75,0:02:32.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,S-sorry...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.58,0:02:34.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.00,0:02:41.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I just... want to be together...\Nwith everyone...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Aw, Amona-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.79,0:02:47.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.79,0:02:51.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wanting to stay with everyone\Nas your dream for the future?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.33,0:02:55.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to give up on being\Nthe housewife to a rich guy, in that case.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,I better find a job.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.00,0:03:00.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,But being a princess is an important job!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.58,0:03:03.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,You've got to protect your citizens, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.33,0:03:07.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, you meant princess in the\N"first lady" sense, Haru-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're totally ignoring\Nthe housewife stuff, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.96,0:03:18.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll have to pick a job I can do\Nwith everybody before I buy the farm...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.79,0:03:20.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.88,0:03:23.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's hard to come up\Nwith something on the spot.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.13,0:03:25.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,You can take your time and think it through.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.00,0:03:27.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,You and everyone together, Amona-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.88,0:03:29.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,R-right...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.71,0:03:30.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.88,0:03:35.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,But you're an adult,\Nso why do you always play with us
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.13,0:03:37.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,instead of working, Roni-sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.75,0:03:38.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.46,0:03:40.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're a real playboy!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.00,0:03:49.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Their chat about future dreams continues on,\Nbrimming with misunderstandings.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.71,0:03:53.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Just another peaceful day at the pre-school.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.79,0:04:04.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,"The Dark Summoner\Nand her Cheerful Coworkers."
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.63,0:04:10.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,We find ourselves in\Na certain office of one company.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.92,0:04:14.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Everybody seems so busy!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.25,0:04:15.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.67,0:04:17.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,You have time on your hands, Haru?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.13,0:04:19.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't I\Nthrow more work your way?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.25,0:04:20.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh? No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.46,0:04:22.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm working! I really am!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,You stirred up the hornet's nest there.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.04,0:04:28.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,You must have time to spare too\Nif you're chattering away like that, Roni.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, I'm quite busy.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.46,0:04:33.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, I am too!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.96,0:04:37.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh? Could you give an example of\Nwhat you're working on, Haru-senpai?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.50,0:04:38.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.00,0:04:43.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ah, see! I've got to answer the phone!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.25,0:04:46.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hello, thank you for calling.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.04,0:04:48.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,You've reached Daiku Samo Inc.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.79,0:04:51.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,As your juniors, we should be doing that...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.29,0:04:54.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Eh? Whazzat?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.08,0:04:58.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, Haru, you should say, "Could you\Nplease repeat that?" Not, "Whazzat?"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.79,0:05:01.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait, just calm down\Nand take it from the top!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,What sort of suggestion is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.46,0:05:05.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's certainly just like Haru-senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.46,0:05:07.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's just making things worse.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.17,0:05:10.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Please be gentle...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.46,0:05:13.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,It sounds like they're getting pretty heated.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.83,0:05:16.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hardly a surprise,\Nwith that sort of response.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.92,0:05:18.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What color?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.96,0:05:19.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Color?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.83,0:05:21.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,You mean my underwear?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.33,0:05:21.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.67,0:05:22.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Black!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.50,0:05:23.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.25,0:05:24.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.83,0:05:26.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.42,0:05:27.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,H-hang on...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.75,0:05:30.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Haru-senpai?\NShould I take over?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.17,0:05:32.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What was that?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.42,0:05:33.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's just a bit noisy on my end.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes? What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.67,0:05:38.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.50,0:05:41.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, noisy?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.08,0:05:42.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Seems like she's doing just fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.63,0:05:45.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,You'd never think she was\Nasked about her underwear color...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.50,0:05:50.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Does the concept of dirty jokes\Njust not exist in Haru's world?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.00,0:05:52.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Won't she get hit with endless\Nsexual harassment, then?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.79,0:05:54.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, she shot it right back at them.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.71,0:05:58.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,A pervert who'd sexually harass\Nsomeone like that would just enjoy it, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.42,0:06:04.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Um, you're panting so hard\Nthat I can't quite make you out.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.21,0:06:07.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,See?! They're getting\Nso worked up you can hear it!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.75,0:06:09.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Haru-san, please let me take over!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.75,0:06:11.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?! An explosion?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.71,0:06:12.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ex...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.38,0:06:13.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Explosion?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.29,0:06:15.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are we talking about a bomb?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.83,0:06:17.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Did it suddenly turn into a bomb threat?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.63,0:06:21.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,W-was it a problem that she asked back\Nabout their underwear after all...?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.38,0:06:25.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Would someone really get furious enough\Nabout that to set up a bomb?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.71,0:06:29.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Could it actually have been... ejaculation?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.71,0:06:30.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Eja...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.21,0:06:31.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ejaculation...?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.92,0:06:33.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't go imagining mine! How rude!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.92,0:06:37.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,You went and looked at it first!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.96,0:06:38.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,You were at fault there, Roni.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.96,0:06:39.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.13,0:06:42.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,It... It's coming?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.04,0:06:46.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ugh, now this guy's saying\Ngross stuff like that?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.38,0:06:47.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,A meteorite?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.54,0:06:48.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,A meteorite?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've completely lost the plot here!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.04,0:06:53.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is this guy a pervert?!\NOr a quack fortune teller?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.21,0:06:55.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,How did we even get to this point?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.08,0:06:57.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh how awful! When is it?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Haru! Don't just trust them!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.17,0:07:02.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's right! A meteorite falling\Nisn't something you can just predict!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.17,0:07:03.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,You can predict a meteorite.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.33,0:07:03.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.79,0:07:07.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's true. Earthquakes are\Nthe ones you can't predict!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.92,0:07:11.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Indeed. If a meteorite is discovered,\Nwe can trace its trajectory.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.13,0:07:13.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, so this guy is either a hero who\Ndiscovered a meteorite headed for Earth,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.96,0:07:16.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,or a complete and utter degenerate?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.13,0:07:18.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Two choices that rarely appear\Naside one another, to be sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.79,0:07:20.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, let's be rational here.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.13,0:07:21.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Even if you can predict a meteorite,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.79,0:07:24.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,it's plenty plausible that it's\Njust a prank, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.25,0:07:29.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,People often brush off the initial discoverer\Nlike that in the movies, don't they?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.21,0:07:30.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Th-that's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.63,0:07:32.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, is this one of those times?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.63,0:07:35.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Does the wrong choice here\Nlead to the end of the world?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.21,0:07:38.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't go talking like our decisions\Nwill change the fate of everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.88,0:07:42.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I can't make you out anymore!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.13,0:07:44.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Chief, could you take over?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.50,0:07:45.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.33,0:07:49.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Their dialect is so thick that I can't tell\Nwhat they're saying at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.08,0:07:52.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,W-wait, their dialect...?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.75,0:07:54.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's not just the accent.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.58,0:07:57.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,There seem to be a lot of\Ndifferent words, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.67,0:07:59.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then I wouldn't understand either!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.83,0:08:01.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,That goes for us too.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.04,0:08:05.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ugh, guess I've got no choice.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.50,0:08:11.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, we can write that stuff about\Na meteor impact off as nonsense, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.83,0:08:14.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's no way it's true, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.67,0:08:19.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,I believe it best to have you handle it\Npersonally and determine that, Chief.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.17,0:08:22.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Indeed. That would be too serious of a\Nresponsibility for those of us on the bottom.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.21,0:08:27.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I guess that's true...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.71,0:08:30.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll take over, Haru. Transfer it.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.29,0:08:31.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.00,0:08:36.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hello. I'm her superior Eury,\Nand I'll be taking this call.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.79,0:08:39.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.71,0:08:41.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.17,0:08:43.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is it gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.83,0:08:45.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm really on edge.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.08,0:08:46.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hopefully it's not a pervert.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.54,0:08:49.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,True. I can't imagine the chief\Nhaving much tolerance for that.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.50,0:08:53.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Chief?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.29,0:08:53.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.96,0:08:56.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ah, was it a pervert after all?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.75,0:09:01.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,They're speaking friggin' French!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.29,0:09:02.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.21,0:09:04.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.83,0:09:07.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, what?!\NHow could you not tell?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you forced yourself\Nto hear it as Japanese at all!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.50,0:09:11.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Did you max out your skill for\Nmishearing stuff or something?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.38,0:09:18.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there and laugh, transfer them\Nto our international department already!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.83,0:09:20.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,O-on it!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.96,0:09:28.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,And so the call was transferred to\Nsomeone who could speak French,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.67,0:09:33.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,and this didn't turn into the prologue\Nto a meteor strike after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:07.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,475.2)}{\an7}For Some Reason, the Dark Summoner's a Pre-Schooler
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(243.2,496.8)}{\an7}The Dark Summoner and Her Cheerful Coworkers

